B.V6=new A.aC("No Guard","Ensures attacks by or against the Pok\xe9mon never miss.")
B.Vw=new A.aC("Oblivious","Keeps the Pok\xe9mon from becoming infatuated or taunted.")
B.VD=new A.aC("Overcoat","Protects the Pok\xe9mon from hail/sandstorm damage and powder moves.")
B.Wg=new A.aC("Overgrow","Powers up Grass-type moves by 50% when HP drops to 1/3 or below.")
B.Vf=new A.aC("Own Tempo","Prevents the Pok\xe9mon from becoming confused.")
B.VG=new A.aC("Pickup","May scavenge useful items; carries no direct battle modifier.")
B.VV=new A.aC("Poison Point","Contact with the Pok\xe9mon may poison the attacker.")
